        'established_subcontracts':[
            'Exact old physical2511/current helper-test tail53..150 now read; prior1..52 plus fresh98 form disjoint full150 own-L12 body union. Supersede only that unread-helper status, not the broader aggregate or native/visual acceptance.',
            'Every closure material batch uses the same typed building/opening association; visibility sync changes facade/range only and never accesses Transform. Helper sets zero start margin and inherits Lod1 fields; new tests express expectations without an executed pass or numeric/native activation claim.',
